# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">İDGAM KAVRAMI VE İDGAM-I MİSLEYN (إدغام المثلين)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.2" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">İDGAM-I MİSLEYN MEAL-GUNNE (GUNNELİ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.1" fill="#1e3a8a">• Tanım: Mahreci ve sıfatı aynı olan iki harften</text>\n  <text x="45" y="104" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">sakin olan نْ veya مْ harfinin kendisi gibi harekeli</text>\n  <text x="45" y="120" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">ن veya م harfine gunneli olarak katılmasıdır.</text>\n  <text x="35" y="146" font-size="11.1" fill="#1e3a8a">• Harfleri: مْ + م  ve  نْ + ن  (2 harf)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="170" font-size="11.1" fill="#1e3a8a">• Örnek: لَهُمْ مَغْفِرَةٌ  |  مِنْ نِعْمَةٍ  |  عَنْ نَفْسٍ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="194" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">• Okunuşu: 1,5 elif miktarı gunne ile şeddeli okunur.</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.2" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">İDGAM-I MİSLEYN BİLÂ-GUNNE (GUNNESİZ)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.1" fill="#14532d">• Tanım: م ve ن dışındaki herhangi bir sakin harften</text>\n  <text x="380" y="104" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">sonra aynı harfin harekeli olarak gelmesiyle</text>\n  <text x="380" y="120" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">gunne yapılmaksızın tek şeddeli harf gibi okunmasıdır.</text>\n  <text x="370" y="146" font-size="11.1" fill="#14532d">• Örnek (بْ + ب): اِضْرِبْ بِعَصَاكَ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="170" font-size="11.1" fill="#14532d">• Örnek (دْ + د): وَقَدْ دَخَلُوا  |  (كْ + ك): يُدْرِكْكُمُ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="194" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">• Okunuşu: Gunne tutulmadan doğrudan şeddelenir.</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Kural: Birinci harf cezimli (sakin), ikinci harf harekeli olduğunda birinci harf ikinciye katılarak şeddeli okunur.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">İDGAM-I MÜTECANİSEYN (إدغام المتجانسين) VE 3 MAHREÇ GRUBU</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#d97706" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="127" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.8" font-weight="bold" fill="#92400e">1. GRUP: ط - د - ت</text>\n  <text x="32" y="88" font-size="10.8" fill="#78350f">• Dil ucu ve üst ön diş dipleri:</text>\n  <text x="32" y="112" font-size="10.8" fill="#78350f">• دْ ⟶ ت : قَدْ تَبَيَّنَ (Tam idgam)</text>\n  <text x="32" y="136" font-size="10.8" fill="#78350f">• تْ ⟶ د : أَثْقَلَتْ دَعَوَا اللّٰهَ</text>\n  <text x="32" y="160" font-size="10.8" fill="#78350f">• تْ ⟶ ط : وَقَالَتْ طَائِفَةٌ</text>\n  <text x="32" y="184" font-size="10.8" fill="#78350f">• طْ ⟶ ت : بَسَطْتَ ، أَحَطْتُ</text>\n  <text x="40" y="202" font-size="10.2" fill="#78350f">(Nakıs idgam: ط sıfatı korunur)</text>\n  <rect x="245" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="350" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.8" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">2. GRUP: ظ - ذ - ث</text>\n  <text x="255" y="88" font-size="10.8" fill="#581c87">• Dil ucu ve ön dişlerin uçları</text>\n  <text x="263" y="104" font-size="10.5" fill="#581c87">(Peltek harfler grubu):</text>\n  <text x="255" y="132" font-size="10.8" fill="#581c87">• ذْ ⟶ ظ : إِذْ ظَلَمُوا</text>\n  <text x="263" y="148" font-size="10.5" fill="#581c87">("İzzalemû" şeklinde okunur)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="176" font-size="10.8" fill="#581c87">• ثْ ⟶ ذ : يَلْهَثْ ذٰلِكَ</text>\n  <text x="263" y="192" font-size="10.5" fill="#581c87">("Yelhezzâlike" şeklinde okunur)</text>\n  <rect x="468" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff1f2" stroke="#e11d48" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="573" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.8" font-weight="bold" fill="#9f1239">3. GRUP: ب - م (DUDAK)</text>\n  <text x="478" y="88" font-size="10.8" fill="#881337">• Dudak mahrecinden çıkan</text>\n  <text x="486" y="104" font-size="10.5" fill="#881337">ب ve م harfleri arasında:</text>\n  <text x="478" y="132" font-size="10.8" fill="#881337">• بْ ⟶ م : يَا بُنَيَّ ارْكَبْ مَعَنَا</text>\n  <text x="486" y="148" font-size="10.5" fill="#881337">(Hûd suresi, 42. ayet)</text>\n  <text x="478" y="176" font-size="10.8" fill="#881337">• Sakin ب harfi م harfine</text>\n  <text x="486" y="192" font-size="10.5" fill="#881337">katılarak gunneli "irkemmeanâ"</text>\n  <text x="486" y="206" font-size="10.5" fill="#881337">şeklinde okunur.</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">İdgam-ı Mütecaniseyn: Mahreçleri (çıkış yerleri) AYNI, sıfatları FARKLI olan harflerin birbirine idgamıdır.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">İDGAM-I MÜTEKARİBEYN (إدغام المتقاربين) VE GENEL TASNİF</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#ecfdf5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.2" font-weight="bold" fill="#065f46">İDGAM-I MÜTEKARİBEYN GRUPLARI</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.1" fill="#064e3b">• Tanım: Mahreçleri veya sıfatları birbirine YAKIN</text>\n  <text x="45" y="104" font-size="10.8" fill="#064e3b">olan iki harfin birbirine katılarak okunmasıdır.</text>\n  <text x="35" y="128" font-size="11.1" fill="#064e3b">• 1. Grup (لْ ⟶ ر): السَّاكِنَةُ اللَّامُ + ر</text>\n  <text x="45" y="144" font-size="10.8" fill="#064e3b">Örnek: وَقُلْ رَبِّ ("Ve kurrabbî"), بَلْ رَفَعَهُ اللّٰهُ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="168" font-size="11.1" fill="#064e3b">• 2. Grup (قْ ⟶ ك): السَّاكِنَةُ الْقَافُ + ك</text>\n  <text x="45" y="184" font-size="10.8" fill="#064e3b">Örnek: أَلَمْ نَخْلُقْكُمْ (Mürselât, 20 — "Nahlukküm")</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.2" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">ÜÇ İDGAMIN KARŞILAŞTIRMA ÖZETİ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="92" font-size="11.1" font-weight="bold" fill="#7c2d12">1. İdgam-ı Misleyn:</text>\n  <text x="380" y="108" font-size="10.8" fill="#7c2d12">Mahreç AYNI + Sıfat AYNI (Aynı iki harf)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="134" font-size="11.1" font-weight="bold" fill="#7c2d12">2. İdgam-ı Mütecaniseyn:</text>\n  <text x="380" y="150" font-size="10.8" fill="#7c2d12">Mahreç AYNI + Sıfat FARKLI (ط-د-ت / ظ-ذ-ث / ب-م)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="176" font-size="11.1" font-weight="bold" fill="#7c2d12">3. İdgam-ı Mütekaribeyn:</text>\n  <text x="380" y="192" font-size="10.8" fill="#7c2d12">Mahreç ve Sıfat YAKIN (لْ+ر ve قْ+ك)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">İstisna: Mutaffifîn 14. ayetteki «كَلَّا بَلْۜ رَانَ» ifadesinde \'sekte\' yapıldığı için لْ harfi ر harfine idgam EDİLMEZ.</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
